      },
      "rev_n_4_b66b4b_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_4_b66b4b_0",
        "node_id": "n_4_b66b4b",
        "thought_text": "Iterate through all unique lines formed by the points (merging collinear points), then check every pair of lines to see if they intersect within the bounding box of the points or simply count all intersections of infinite lines, ensuring to handle parallel lines correctly.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-4670529625405132388",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794590188.6100204
      },
      "rev_n_5_0fe53a_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_5_0fe53a_0",
        "node_id": "n_5_0fe53a",
        "thought_text": "Represent each line by its normalized coefficients (A, B, C) to avoid floating-point issues, generate the set of unique lines, and use a nested loop to count pairs where the determinant of the line coefficients is non-zero (indicating intersection).",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-4670529625405132388",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794590188.6100442
      },
      "rev_n_6_b899a9_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_6_b899a9_0",
        "node_id": "n_6_b899a9",
        "thought_text": "Since N is small (up to 50), a brute-force approach is feasible: generate all lines, store them in a set to remove duplicates, then count intersecting pairs by checking if lines are not parallel and not identical.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-4670529625405132388",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794590188.6100574
      },
      "rev_n_7_7222e2_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_7_7222e2_0",
        "node_id": "n_7_7222e2",
        "thought_text": "Generate all unique lines defined by pairs of points, handling collinear points by merging them into single lines, then iterate through all pairs of these lines to count intersections, excluding parallel or identical lines.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-2570079942259561846",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
